---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Security Acknowledgements">
  <div class="prose-page">
    <h1>Security Acknowledgements</h1>
    <p class="lead">Recognizing researchers who help keep secunit, llc secure.</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      secunit, llc deeply values the contributions of the independent security research community.
      We believe that coordinated vulnerability disclosure is essential to maintaining a hardened,
      resilient infrastructure.
    </p>
    <p>
      This page honors security researchers who have discovered and reported qualifying
      vulnerabilities in good faith, in accordance with our <a href="/security"
        >Security Disclosure Policy</a
      > and
      <a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9116" rel="noopener noreferrer">RFC 9116</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Hall of Fame</h2>
    <p>
      Researchers who submit validated, non-duplicate reports and adhere to coordinated disclosure
      guidelines are recognized below (with their permission).
    </p>

    <div class="my-6 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-6">
      <p class="m-0 text-sm text-neutral-400">
        No public disclosures have been recorded yet for the current period. We sincerely thank
        everyone who audits our perimeter responsibly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Reporting a Vulnerability</h2>
    <p>
      If you have discovered a potential security vulnerability, please review our
      <a href="/security">Security Disclosure Policy</a> and send an encrypted report to
      <a href="mailto:security@secunit.io">security@secunit.io</a> using our published GPG encryption
      keys.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
